<div id="backoffice">
    <p>
        Two factor auth is required here, and this is your enrolment.  It does
        not change, so if you lose your authenticator you scan this same code
        into the next one.
    </p>
    Use the following URI, or scan the below QR code into your authenticator Application of choice:<br />
    <: $uri :>
    <br />
    <img src="/totp_qr/<: $qr :>" alt="TOTP QR Code" loading="lazy" />
    <br />
    Current Code (<: $timestamp :>): <: $cur_code :>
</div>
